node.doctext:
Hello,
If somebody could help me out with this variable scoping problem, it would be greatly appreciated.

<p>Program a.pl
<code>
use strict;
use warnings;

our ($database);

$database = "test1";
</code>
</p>

<p>Program b.pl
<code>
use strict;
use warnings;

our ($database);

$database = "test2";
</code>
</p>

<p>
Program c.pl
<code>
require "a.pl";
print "$database\n";
require "b.pl";
print "$database\n";
require "a.pl";
print "$database\n";
</code>
</p>

<p>
The output from program c.pl is as follows:
<code>
test1
test2
test2
</code>
</p>

<p>
I would like the output to be as follows:
<code>
test1
test2
test1
</code>
</p>

What am I doing wrong?
